            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EAn Umbraco 17 backoffice package that adds an Evaluate Page button to the content editor toolbar. When clicked, it sends the current page\u0026#39;s content to an AI model and returns a structured quality report directly inside the backoffice, including scored checks, warnings, and actionable suggestions.\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://marketplace.umbraco.com/package/proworks.umbraco.ai.pageevaluator\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
